WEBVTT

00:00:13.160 --> 00:00:17.870
"Area Map"

00:00:18.790 --> 00:00:20.540
Umm...

00:00:20.540 --> 00:00:23.160
If north is this way, then..

00:00:20.540 --> 00:00:23.160
'm hungry.

00:00:23.160 --> 00:00:24.290
Wanna get some food?

00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:27.450
I hear there's a new cake place down that way.

00:00:27.450 --> 00:00:30.250
Everyone's saying it's super good,
so let's check it out!

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:32.790
You always find stuff out so fast.

00:00:32.790 --> 00:00:35.910
What fancy people...That's Tokyo for you.

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:41.000
Hey, isn't that a cute one back there?

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:42.950
Oh, that girl there?

00:00:42.950 --> 00:00:44.910
What? Isn't that a boy?

00:00:44.910 --> 00:00:46.160
No, that's a girl.

00:00:46.160 --> 00:00:48.450
That's definitely a boy! Isn't that right?

00:00:50.950 --> 00:00:52.370
Good question...

00:00:52.700 --> 00:00:54.450
"Tanamachi"

00:00:54.450 --> 00:00:56.620
"Tears of the gods"

00:00:57.790 --> 00:00:59.620
Um, excuse me...

00:00:59.660 --> 00:01:02.540
"Yatsuho Liquor"

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:02.540
Sunohara House?

00:01:02.540 --> 00:01:06.330
Keep going this way and
take a right at the second corner.

00:01:06.330 --> 00:01:08.830
Continue straight until
you eventually get there.

00:01:08.830 --> 00:01:10.660
Thank you very much.

00:01:10.660 --> 00:01:13.540
You wouldn't happen to be
moving in to the dorm, would you?

00:01:13.540 --> 00:01:18.830
I am! My name is Aki Shiina.
It's nice to meet you, ma'am.

00:01:18.830 --> 00:01:22.290
Aki, is it? Welcome and good luck!

00:01:28.450 --> 00:01:32.330
What a cute kid.
Ayaka's going to be very happy!

00:01:34.700 --> 00:01:39.620
Today is the day I move in to a dorm
for the middle school I decided to attend.

00:01:39.620 --> 00:01:44.200
Because of my facial features,
I wasn't treated as a guy back home...

00:01:44.200 --> 00:01:46.580
But today will be the start
of my new manly life!

00:01:47.580 --> 00:01:49.830
To my middle school debut!

00:01:58.750 --> 00:02:02.410
Can't I get a better omen than a rain shower?

00:02:04.040 --> 00:02:07.000
"Sunohara House"

00:02:12.620 --> 00:02:14.290
Good afternoon!

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:17.580
Hello?

00:02:21.620 --> 00:02:23.790
Maybe no one's home...

00:02:28.540 --> 00:02:29.950
Guess who!

00:02:30.950 --> 00:02:32.540
Hey! What's the big--

00:02:37.450 --> 00:02:42.450
Nice to meet you! I'm the caretaker
of Sunohara House, Ayaka Sunohara.

00:02:46.410 --> 00:02:48.660
I hope you like it here.

00:04:22.080 --> 00:04:24.370
Huh? Careta...?

00:04:24.370 --> 00:04:28.040
That's right. The caretaker, Ayaka Sunohara.

00:04:28.040 --> 00:04:30.040
I... Uh...

00:04:33.830 --> 00:04:36.080
And you're Aki Shiina, right?

00:04:37.870 --> 00:04:39.370
Huh?

00:04:39.370 --> 00:04:40.870
Hellooooo?

00:04:43.910 --> 00:04:46.790
Well, right now, it doesn't matter who you are!

00:04:46.790 --> 00:04:49.790
You'll catch a cold, young lady,
and we can't have that!

00:05:00.330 --> 00:05:02.830
Wait! This is no time to relax!

00:05:02.830 --> 00:05:04.580
Nobody said anything about this!

00:05:04.580 --> 00:05:07.370
Such a young, pretty lady!

00:05:07.370 --> 00:05:12.870
Hold on. If she's the caretaker,
then that means...

00:05:12.870 --> 00:05:16.660
For the next three years, I'll be under
the same roof with that pretty woman?

00:05:18.330 --> 00:05:19.540
I'm coming in!

00:05:24.500 --> 00:05:29.790
It's tradition in this dorm for the caretaker
to wash the new resident's back.

00:05:29.790 --> 00:05:34.540
Until now, Grandmother has been doing it,
but she's been hospitalized.

00:05:34.540 --> 00:05:37.040
So starting this year, that duty is mine.

00:05:37.040 --> 00:05:39.580
To My Honored Father in Shizuoka,

00:05:39.580 --> 00:05:43.120
I trust you are, as ever, in good health.
Your son perfectly enjoys his.

00:05:43.120 --> 00:05:45.120
Tokyo is an amazing place.

00:05:45.120 --> 00:05:46.200
In Tokyo--

00:05:47.290 --> 00:05:48.290
Are you all right?

00:05:51.450 --> 00:05:56.000
Come now. No need to be embarrassed.

00:05:56.000 --> 00:05:59.200
It's just us girls in here.

00:05:59.200 --> 00:06:00.950
Honestly, I'm surprised.

00:06:00.950 --> 00:06:04.040
Now, let's wash your back. Step out.

00:06:04.040 --> 00:06:06.750
"J-Just us girls"?!

00:06:10.290 --> 00:06:11.910
There. Now let's get started!

00:06:13.290 --> 00:06:17.540
Heh, heh. I don't know why,
but she seems to think we're a girl.

00:06:17.540 --> 00:06:19.790
Let's just keep quiet about it!

00:06:19.790 --> 00:06:20.790
We mustn't!

00:06:20.790 --> 00:06:24.040
Only by acting like a man
can one become truly manly.

00:06:24.040 --> 00:06:25.870
Good point!

00:06:25.870 --> 00:06:27.120
Now that we have a plan...

00:06:27.120 --> 00:06:29.080
...time to execute!

00:06:29.080 --> 00:06:31.200
Miss Caretaker, the truth is--

00:06:31.870 --> 00:06:33.080
Yes?

00:06:33.080 --> 00:06:35.290
Oh, it's nothing...

00:06:41.870 --> 00:06:43.410
The truth is...

00:06:43.410 --> 00:06:44.950
Don't worry!

00:06:43.410 --> 00:06:44.950
...I'm, like, a guy!

00:06:44.950 --> 00:06:49.330
Everyone grows at their own pace,
so even if they look the same as a guy--

00:06:49.330 --> 00:06:50.410
Listen to me!

00:06:52.830 --> 00:06:54.450
I see.

00:06:54.450 --> 00:06:56.540
I understand the situation.

00:06:56.540 --> 00:07:03.000
Until now, only girls have
moved in here, so I just assumed.

00:07:03.000 --> 00:07:06.160
Now that you know I'm a guy,
why are you still here?

00:07:06.160 --> 00:07:08.660
This is super embarrassing!

00:07:08.660 --> 00:07:13.790
"Why"? Don't be silly!
I have to wash your back.

00:07:13.790 --> 00:07:15.580
You're in my bubble!

00:07:15.580 --> 00:07:21.620
Boy or girl, it doesn't matter. You're still a kid.

00:07:21.620 --> 00:07:27.080
So from now on, I'll be taking care
of all your caretaking needs.

00:07:30.910 --> 00:07:31.910
Goodness!

00:07:35.500 --> 00:07:40.370
Huh...? When did I pass out?

00:07:40.370 --> 00:07:46.040
Oh, well, who cares?
Somehow I feel so warm and coz--

00:07:46.040 --> 00:07:47.250
Oh, my!

00:07:49.000 --> 00:07:51.830
Hey now, that tickles!

00:07:52.950 --> 00:07:54.660
I can't see her head.

00:07:56.580 --> 00:07:57.870
S-Sorry!

00:07:57.870 --> 00:08:00.330
I must have passed out in the bath and--

00:08:00.330 --> 00:08:05.120
Y-Yes. I worried you might catch a chill...

00:08:06.450 --> 00:08:08.120
Wait, I have clothes on?

00:08:09.370 --> 00:08:10.750
Does that mean...?

00:08:10.750 --> 00:08:13.830
You really are a boy, aren't you?

00:08:13.830 --> 00:08:19.910
Since your face and name seemed feminine,
I totally mistook you for a girl.

00:08:19.910 --> 00:08:25.950
It doesn't quite make up for it, but from
now on, I'll do all I can to care for you.

00:08:25.950 --> 00:08:28.330
Th-Thank you.

00:08:28.330 --> 00:08:30.830
But I'm not dwelling on that.

00:08:32.410 --> 00:08:34.410
Oh! Don't worry!

00:08:34.410 --> 00:08:37.790
Your size is perfectly normal,
for your age, I'm sure.

00:08:37.790 --> 00:08:40.370
Not that I would know.

00:08:37.790 --> 00:08:40.370
What are you talking about?!

00:08:40.370 --> 00:08:44.080
Anyway, I have to prepare for supper.

00:08:44.080 --> 00:08:47.830
When everything's ready, I'll come get you.
Okay? Just wait for a bit.

00:08:47.830 --> 00:08:50.080
What're you doing?!

00:08:50.080 --> 00:08:52.950
Getting a "youth power" charge!

00:08:56.160 --> 00:09:01.450
It appears the caretaker is good at everything
and does all the work herself.

00:09:01.450 --> 00:09:04.250
Perfect!

00:09:01.450 --> 00:09:04.250
She's also a beauty, and very nice.

00:09:04.910 --> 00:09:06.200
It's just...

00:09:06.200 --> 00:09:07.660
Aki- <i>chan</i> !

00:09:07.660 --> 00:09:11.040
...there's no indication that
she'll treat me like a man.

00:09:11.040 --> 00:09:17.660
E-Excuse me! Um...
Please don't call me Aki- <i>chan</i> .

00:09:17.660 --> 00:09:20.870
What? But it's so cute!

00:09:20.870 --> 00:09:22.200
Aki- <i>chan</i> !

00:09:25.370 --> 00:09:28.870
Aki, you look so much like a girl!

00:09:28.870 --> 00:09:32.540
As your sister, maybe I should
just help you be one!

00:09:33.500 --> 00:09:34.750
Aki- <i>chan</i> .

00:09:35.410 --> 00:09:36.500
Aki- <i>chan</i> .

00:09:37.410 --> 00:09:38.410
Aki- <i>chan</i> .

00:09:41.250 --> 00:09:42.750
Oh, the food!

00:09:43.790 --> 00:09:47.790
I thought by coming to Tokyo,
my life would be different.

00:09:47.790 --> 00:09:49.950
I thought I would be manly.

00:09:49.950 --> 00:09:54.000
But... I guess it'll just be
the same here after all.

00:09:54.000 --> 00:09:57.870
No, it's too early to lose hope.
It's still the first day!

00:09:57.870 --> 00:10:00.580
And if I change, even
the caretaker might see me as--

00:10:00.580 --> 00:10:02.330
Go for it, Aki- <i>kun</i> .

00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:10.250
First, as a man, I've got
to show that I'm reliable.

00:10:10.910 --> 00:10:14.120
Miss Caretaker, I'll help you!

00:10:14.120 --> 00:10:16.830
You just need me to hang
the clothes in this basket, right?

00:10:20.000 --> 00:10:22.250
Oh... Oh, my...

00:10:22.250 --> 00:10:26.540
Aki- <i>chan</i> , I'm happy you would help me,

00:10:26.540 --> 00:10:29.750
but I'll take care of my things.

00:10:29.750 --> 00:10:31.620
Naughty Aki- <i>chan</i> .

00:10:35.500 --> 00:10:38.370
You can take care of the sheets, Aki- <i>chan</i> .

00:10:38.370 --> 00:10:39.830
O-Okay!

00:10:52.580 --> 00:10:55.080
Next come the flower beds.

00:10:55.080 --> 00:10:56.450
Allow me!

00:11:03.910 --> 00:11:05.950
And now to scrub the floors.

00:11:05.950 --> 00:11:07.200
I'll do it!

00:11:09.580 --> 00:11:10.950
Careful, there's wax on the--

00:11:12.830 --> 00:11:14.000
Are you all right?

00:11:14.000 --> 00:11:15.450
I'm fine.

00:11:17.200 --> 00:11:20.000
I've decided to be manly.

00:11:20.000 --> 00:11:25.660
Ever since I was little, my sister
has been telling me I'm like a girl.

00:11:25.660 --> 00:11:29.790
I came to Tokyo alone because
I want to change that about myself.

00:11:29.790 --> 00:11:31.080
And so I...

00:11:32.660 --> 00:11:35.660
You don't have to strain yourself.

00:11:35.660 --> 00:11:38.830
I'm sorry I didn't realize how you felt.

00:11:38.830 --> 00:11:42.200
I have to think more before I act.

00:11:43.660 --> 00:11:46.830
From now on, I'll call you Akkun, okay?

00:11:46.830 --> 00:11:49.330
Miss Caretaker.

00:11:49.330 --> 00:11:51.160
Akkuuun!

00:11:51.160 --> 00:11:53.330
Nothing's really changed!

00:11:53.330 --> 00:11:56.910
Um, if possible, could you also stop
treating me like a kid?

00:11:56.910 --> 00:11:58.160
No can do.

00:11:58.160 --> 00:12:01.120
You're very much still a kid, Akkun.

00:12:01.120 --> 00:12:03.080
No more straining yourself.

00:12:03.080 --> 00:12:05.160
If you insist on adult treatment...

00:12:07.450 --> 00:12:08.700
Akkun.

00:12:14.370 --> 00:12:19.120
I'll do it no problem
if you give me a kiss on the cheek.

00:12:20.120 --> 00:12:22.230
"A boy is moving into the dorm this year!"

00:12:21.200 --> 00:12:24.000
Ayaka says the new kid is a boy.

00:12:24.000 --> 00:12:25.200
Really?

00:12:25.200 --> 00:12:27.250
This never happens!

00:12:27.250 --> 00:12:30.540
This means we'll have to educate him rigorously.

00:12:31.620 --> 00:12:34.580
"Adult treatment"?
"Adult treatment"? "Adult treatment"?

00:12:34.580 --> 00:12:37.500
"Adult treatment"?
"Adult treatment"? "Adult"...

00:12:37.500 --> 00:12:40.830
The Tanamachi Middle School
Student Council has arrived!

00:12:44.290 --> 00:12:46.620
How could you do that right in the entryway?!

00:12:52.040 --> 00:12:55.040
Stop, stop, <i>stop</i> !

00:12:55.040 --> 00:12:59.040
Jeez, Ms. Ayaka! I've told you
to stop all this dirty stuff!

00:12:59.040 --> 00:13:00.790
It was just an attempt.

00:13:00.790 --> 00:13:02.330
No attempts either!

00:13:02.330 --> 00:13:05.580
All three of us are Ms. Ayaka's victims, too.

00:13:05.580 --> 00:13:06.580
Tall!

00:13:06.580 --> 00:13:09.160
Did she do any weird stuff to you?

00:13:09.160 --> 00:13:10.160
"Weird stuff"?

00:13:10.160 --> 00:13:13.250
C'mon. Don't make me say it.
It's too embarrassing.

00:13:14.370 --> 00:13:17.910
If that's what you're up against,
what man wouldn't be enthralled?

00:13:19.700 --> 00:13:26.200
H-Hold on. Then the things she's been
doing to me, she's done to every resident?

00:13:26.200 --> 00:13:31.580
We told her no excessive physical contact,
but it looks like that's too much to ask.

00:13:32.620 --> 00:13:35.870
See how small and adorable the president is?

00:13:35.870 --> 00:13:39.250
Ms. Ayaka is particularly exuberant
with her affection toward her.

00:13:39.250 --> 00:13:40.790
Don't be mad, okay?

00:13:40.790 --> 00:13:42.790
This is still too much--

00:13:43.200 --> 00:13:46.410
It's not fair that I still have to do
that secretly when she's asleep...

00:13:46.410 --> 00:13:50.830
Huh? I didn't exactly hate the incident
just now or the one in the bath.

00:13:50.830 --> 00:13:53.040
But what does this mean for my feelings?

00:13:53.040 --> 00:13:54.870
Hey, cheer up!

00:13:56.620 --> 00:13:59.750
Now that I think about it, I haven't
introduced myself yet, have I?

00:13:59.750 --> 00:14:04.250
Yuzu Yukimoto. I'm the Tanamachi
Middle School Student Council President.

00:14:04.250 --> 00:14:06.700
If you need help with anything,
please feel free to--

00:14:08.250 --> 00:14:10.410
Hey! I was just getting to the good part!

00:14:10.410 --> 00:14:12.660
How am I supposed to set
a good example for the new kid?

00:14:13.910 --> 00:14:16.870
I'm Sumire Yamanashi, the Vice President.

00:14:16.870 --> 00:14:19.620
Please just take care of your nosebleed.

00:14:19.620 --> 00:14:23.000
The characters are "moon," "view,"
and "countryside," but it's read "Yamanashi."

00:14:23.000 --> 00:14:24.580
Oh, it's just so cool!

00:14:26.910 --> 00:14:29.750
W-W-We're gonna fall over! We're falling!

00:14:30.580 --> 00:14:33.950
I'm Yuri Kazami.
I'm the Student Council Secretary.

00:14:33.950 --> 00:14:36.410
Call me Yuri. Don't worry about titles.

00:14:36.410 --> 00:14:39.750
Thank goodness! Someone who seems normal.

00:14:40.750 --> 00:14:42.160
I'm a maid waitress!

00:14:46.250 --> 00:14:49.410
I'm Aki Shiina. I look forward to living here.

00:14:49.410 --> 00:14:52.200
As your senior, I'm going
to educate you diligently.

00:14:53.330 --> 00:14:54.790
That's not acceptable.

00:14:54.790 --> 00:14:57.790
It's my job to take care of everyone's needs.

00:14:57.790 --> 00:14:59.410
You're too close again!

00:15:01.660 --> 00:15:06.660
I'm curious about something.
What is it that you have on your head?

00:15:07.620 --> 00:15:10.250
How could you ask me to reveal something
so embarrassing when we've only just met?

00:15:10.250 --> 00:15:12.500
Oh, I-I'm so sorry.

00:15:12.500 --> 00:15:14.290
Just kidding!

00:15:14.290 --> 00:15:16.040
You're funny!

00:15:16.040 --> 00:15:18.080
She dodged the question.

00:15:18.080 --> 00:15:20.330
She's so cute.

00:15:20.330 --> 00:15:21.950
Yamanashi- <i>sempai</i> .

00:15:21.950 --> 00:15:26.250
She wears that in an effort to seem taller.

00:15:26.250 --> 00:15:27.250
Keep it a secret.

00:15:27.250 --> 00:15:28.870
Oh, I see...

00:15:28.870 --> 00:15:31.540
It seems she has a complex
about how short she is.

00:15:31.540 --> 00:15:33.330
She drinks milk every day,

00:15:33.330 --> 00:15:35.410
and secretly massages her chest in the bath--

00:15:33.330 --> 00:15:35.410
How do you know that?

00:15:36.700 --> 00:15:38.750
You know too much.

00:15:38.750 --> 00:15:39.910
You'll have to disappear.

00:15:39.910 --> 00:15:41.120
That's not fair!

00:15:42.120 --> 00:15:44.330
President, it's time we go to our rooms.

00:15:44.330 --> 00:15:45.660
Oh, yeah, it is.

00:15:45.660 --> 00:15:48.700
If you only judged by their heights,
they could be mother and daughter.

00:15:48.700 --> 00:15:50.290
Aren't they good together?

00:15:50.290 --> 00:15:51.580
Ah! When did you get there?

00:15:51.580 --> 00:15:56.000
The three of us have been
together since we were little.

00:15:56.000 --> 00:16:00.160
But Sumire's not proactive,
so there's been no progress.

00:16:00.160 --> 00:16:04.620
This is the year I'll finally get them together,
so you have to assist me, okay?

00:16:04.620 --> 00:16:07.750
S-Sure...

00:16:07.750 --> 00:16:12.700
All right, you three. I have to make dinner,
so take your baths now, okay?

00:16:12.700 --> 00:16:15.620
I'll make all of your favorite foods today.

00:16:15.620 --> 00:16:16.700
Jackpot!

00:16:16.700 --> 00:16:19.040
Sumire, Yuri, shall we all bathe together today?

00:16:21.160 --> 00:16:22.450
You're bleeding.

00:16:25.250 --> 00:16:27.830
Akkun, shall we pick up where we left off?

00:16:27.830 --> 00:16:29.370
What?!

00:16:30.080 --> 00:16:31.790
Just teasing.

00:16:31.790 --> 00:16:35.120
Time to make a ton of food. Yep!

00:16:40.540 --> 00:16:42.660
What was all that?! What's going on?!

00:16:42.660 --> 00:16:47.950
If she interacts with everyone that way,
she can't have meant anything by that.

00:16:47.950 --> 00:16:49.250
But...

00:16:54.830 --> 00:16:58.330
Akkun, today's the school entrance ceremony.

00:16:59.160 --> 00:17:00.750
Wakey-wakey!

00:17:03.080 --> 00:17:04.750
If you're not going to get up...

00:17:07.750 --> 00:17:09.370
Miss Caretaker!

00:17:09.370 --> 00:17:11.750
It's your fault for not getting up.

00:17:11.750 --> 00:17:13.540
Okay, okay. I'll get up!

00:17:13.540 --> 00:17:17.160
It's too early for all this noise.
What's going on?

00:17:20.910 --> 00:17:24.200
Inappropriate! How many times do I
have to warn you about physical contact?

00:17:21.540 --> 00:17:24.200
It's been a week since
I arrived at Sunohara House.

00:17:24.200 --> 00:17:26.120
Every day is like this.

00:17:26.120 --> 00:17:28.330
But today is finally the day
of the entrance ceremony.

00:17:28.330 --> 00:17:30.330
I've got to focus!

00:17:34.370 --> 00:17:38.000
The student council has to prepare
for the ceremony, so we're leaving early.

00:17:38.000 --> 00:17:41.080
Just because you'll be alone doesn't mean
you can do anything weird, got it?

00:17:41.080 --> 00:17:42.870
All right, see you later!

00:17:42.870 --> 00:17:45.290
Bye, have fun.

00:17:45.290 --> 00:17:49.160
They take their student council positions
very seriously, don't they?

00:17:49.160 --> 00:17:54.540
Yes. They seem to be admired by
the other students and have lots of friends.

00:17:57.540 --> 00:17:59.160
Akkun!

00:17:59.160 --> 00:18:03.290
It feels like it's been forever since
the last time we were alone.

00:18:03.290 --> 00:18:05.790
That's right...

00:18:05.790 --> 00:18:07.750
Akkun?

00:18:07.750 --> 00:18:11.450
I just charged ahead with
my decision to come to Tokyo.

00:18:11.450 --> 00:18:15.080
I don't know anyone,
let alone have any friends here.

00:18:15.080 --> 00:18:18.370
What if they bully me for being
a country boy? And what if...

00:18:19.700 --> 00:18:22.080
Um, are you listening to me?

00:18:24.450 --> 00:18:28.830
A-ha! Akkun, I have an idea!

00:18:28.830 --> 00:18:31.620
I'll be right back. Wait here, okay?

00:18:33.040 --> 00:18:35.290
I have a bad feeling about this...

00:18:42.330 --> 00:18:44.620
I'm back.

00:18:44.620 --> 00:18:47.000
Ta-da! What do you think?

00:18:47.000 --> 00:18:49.540
This is my uniform from high school.

00:18:49.540 --> 00:18:51.450
"Th-Think"?

00:18:51.450 --> 00:18:56.410
Talking to someone you don't know
can be nerve-racking, right?

00:18:56.410 --> 00:18:59.950
What? I mean, you get nervous?

00:18:59.950 --> 00:19:01.370
But don't worry!

00:19:01.370 --> 00:19:03.160
Leave it to me!

00:19:03.160 --> 00:19:07.950
Let's practice making conversation.
Pretend I'm a girl in your grade!

00:19:07.950 --> 00:19:10.120
In my grade?!

00:19:10.120 --> 00:19:14.160
Hold up. If I nail this conversation
with her like a man...

00:19:14.160 --> 00:19:18.370
...then won't she see me
as a full-fledged man?

00:19:14.160 --> 00:19:18.370
Aki- <i>kun</i> , I love you!

00:19:19.120 --> 00:19:20.660
O-Okay!

00:19:20.660 --> 00:19:25.290
H-Hello! My name is Aki Shiina.
Nice to meet you.

00:19:25.290 --> 00:19:28.790
I'm Ayaka Sunohara. Nice to meet you, too.

00:19:28.790 --> 00:19:30.160
She's really getting into this.

00:19:30.160 --> 00:19:33.370
Hey, hey, where did you move from?

00:19:33.370 --> 00:19:36.250
Shizuoka, ma'am-- Er, from Shizuoka.

00:19:36.250 --> 00:19:39.620
The way she's guiding me with questions
makes it easier to hold a conversation.

00:19:36.250 --> 00:19:40.200
Oh, you know what?
My grampa's also from Shizuoka.

00:19:39.620 --> 00:19:42.790
I'm grateful.

00:19:40.200 --> 00:19:42.790
Let's see, what else?
Have you eaten at Sawayaka?

00:19:42.790 --> 00:19:46.330
Oh! It's supposed to rain this afternoon.
Did you bring an umbrella?

00:19:46.330 --> 00:19:48.500
Do you like younger women or older women?

00:19:48.500 --> 00:19:50.500
Older!

00:19:50.500 --> 00:19:54.540
Wait, no, um, I mean... This isn't helping!

00:19:55.330 --> 00:19:57.700
I have no choice, then...

00:19:57.700 --> 00:19:59.160
At this point it's my only option.

00:20:01.660 --> 00:20:03.120
Wai-- Why are you taking that off?

00:20:05.870 --> 00:20:09.040
Don't they say
"In male friendships, all is laid bare"?

00:20:09.040 --> 00:20:11.040
Where'd you hear that piece of wisdom?!

00:20:12.200 --> 00:20:16.580
Akkun, are you still anxious?

00:20:16.580 --> 00:20:19.660
The truth is I'm nervous, too.

00:20:19.660 --> 00:20:23.200
See? Feel how hard my heart is pounding?

00:20:24.330 --> 00:20:25.330
Oh, my!

00:20:27.000 --> 00:20:30.200
Wh-What are you doing?!

00:20:30.200 --> 00:20:33.000
I was just kidding about being nervous.

00:20:33.000 --> 00:20:36.160
But if you have that much spirit,
then you should do just fine.

00:20:36.160 --> 00:20:38.410
Now my heart's pounding
for a different reason!

00:20:39.290 --> 00:20:41.200
Oh, it's already this late?

00:20:41.200 --> 00:20:44.080
Miss Caretaker, I need to go get my bag.

00:20:44.080 --> 00:20:45.790
Don't worry!

00:20:46.870 --> 00:20:51.080
Caring for your time is also part of my duties.

00:20:51.080 --> 00:20:54.000
You went in my room without permission again?

00:20:55.370 --> 00:20:57.040
Okay, I'll see you later!

00:20:57.040 --> 00:20:58.620
Hold on, Akkun.

00:21:01.160 --> 00:21:06.410
I know you'll make lots
of friends. I guarantee it.

00:21:09.250 --> 00:21:10.410
Good luck!

00:21:13.200 --> 00:21:18.200
Nothing else happened that day
to make my heart race so fast.

00:21:21.040 --> 00:21:24.540
I see. So you did your
self-introduction very nicely.

00:21:24.540 --> 00:21:25.870
I'm glad.

00:21:25.870 --> 00:21:30.250
Thanks to the practice I did this morning,
I didn't get that nervous when I spoke.

00:21:30.250 --> 00:21:32.700
And everyone in class seemed nice.

00:21:32.700 --> 00:21:34.870
I think this is going to work.

00:21:36.540 --> 00:21:39.500
You've been trying so hard,
haven't you, Akkun?

00:21:39.500 --> 00:21:41.370
You're a good boy.

00:21:41.370 --> 00:21:43.330
Miss Caretaker.

00:21:45.290 --> 00:21:50.330
You can come to me any time
you have a problem.

00:21:50.330 --> 00:21:53.450
This is Sunohara House,
and I take care of things around here!

00:21:55.540 --> 00:22:02.000
This is how the curtain opened
on my life in a dorm.

00:21:58.040 --> 00:22:02.000
"Sunohara House"

00:23:32.000 --> 00:23:42.000
"Special Training, Snip Snip, Fears"
